       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. NEGOCIO1.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WRK-AUDIT               PIC X(08) VALUE 'EXTERNO9'.
       LINKAGE SECTION.
       01  DFHCOMMAREA.
           COPY COMAREA.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-PRINCIPAL SECTION.
           EXEC SQL SELECT NOME INTO :NOME FROM DB2PRD.TCLI
                WHERE ID = :CLI-ID END-EXEC
           IF SQLCODE EQUAL ZEROS
              MOVE 00 TO RETORNO OF DFHCOMMAREA
              CALL 'EXTERNO9' USING DFHCOMMAREA
           ELSE
              MOVE 04 TO RETORNO
           END-IF
           GOBACK.
